# their separate policy-exception shape. A type selector expands only exact
# rows present in that fresh scan; it is not authorization for future same-type
# findings. Legacy producer eras remain readable but never acquire continuation
# rights.
# `check_batch_close.py` is the sole close-bundle producer. Its successful
# publication appends, in order, one distinct `closed_list_<member>` pass
